# Frontend

See also: `docs/009_UI_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, `docs/010_COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md`, `docs/012_FRONTEND_STANDARD.md`

## Next.js

- App Router under `app/`
- Export `metadata` / `generateMetadata` on public pages
- Prefer Server Components; isolate client islands
- Use `useDeferredValue` / `startTransition` for responsive filtering when useful
- Avoid premature `useMemo` / `useCallback`

## UI structure

- Atoms → molecules → organisms in `components/`
- Feature compositions in `frontend/features/`
- Style with Tailwind + CSS variables from `styles/globals.css`
- Merge classes with `cn()` (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`)
- Variants via `class-variance-authority` where appropriate

## UX / a11y / SEO

- WCAG AA contrast and visible focus
- Semantic landmarks; label icon-only controls
- Responsive mobile + desktop
- Brand-first heroes on marketing surfaces; no hero card clutter
- Intentional Framer Motion only (respect `prefers-reduced-motion`)

## Design anti-patterns

Avoid default AI-looking themes: purple-on-white, cream+terracotta brochure, glow-heavy dark neo UI, pill clusters, dashboard clutter in first viewport.
